      {
        "id": 3949800880,
        "type": null,
        "body": "Scheduled as **S15** of the vessel study, resolved in the `../Luminari-Source-vessels-ships` worktree after S13 (#13) and S14 (#12):\n\n- Branch: `feat/vessels-s15`, to be cut from S14's merge commit with the annotated tag `vessels-s15-base`.\n- Plan and record: [`docs/ongoing-projects/vessels-ships.md`](https://gitlab.com/max757/Luminari-Source/-/blob/feat/vessels-s13/docs/ongoing-projects/vessels-ships.md#part-5-implementation-sequence), Part 5 item 15 (commit b1a42c2c3, on `feat/vessels-s13`).\n- The step does not depend on S13 or S14; it comes last so the two items filed before it keep their order.\n- The S15 merge request will say `Closes #14`, so it is listed here and closes this item when it merges.\n\nNot started yet.",
        "author": {
