  {
    "id": "196c10252af03d41eefe22c9aada996e61f3f332",
    "individual_note": true,
    "resolvable": false,
    "notes": [
      {
        "id": 3951453321,
        "type": null,
        "body": "S15 is built, verified and handed to review as !22 (tag `vessels-s15`, range `vessels-s15-base..vessels-s15`).\n\n- All fifteen movements now write and check both stores inside the command: a purchase saves the gold first and is refunded and undone if the ship's side cannot be written; a payout writes the ship's side first and is put back if the gold cannot be saved. The shared code is `src/vessels/vessels_payment.c`.\n- Verified on the tagged code: `make test-all` with the database cases on (2,034 tests), the vessel help verifier, 22 of 22 live gate jobs, and 33 of 33 local CI jobs. The loss gate now plays a hull purchase and a trade-in whose runtime row the database refuses.\n- The record, with the interpretations, what an independent read found before hand-off and what is left after the merge (the help sync of five entries, closing the study documents), is the Phase 15 section of [`docs/ongoing-projects/vessels-ships.md`](https://gitlab.com/max757/Luminari-Source/-/blob/feat/vessels-s15/docs/ongoing-projects/vessels-ships.md#phase-15-s15-progress).\n\nNot merged; the merge closes this item.",
        "author": {
          "id": 42759441,
          "username": "max757",
          "public_email": "",
          "name": "Max aka Mosheh",
          "state": "active",
          "locked": false,
          "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/3c7c169343bd7d0f4575137ce8065aee7cb44024d447bbfe66d773133a81c43e?s=80&d=identicon",
